'''''Atrichum''''' is a genus of [[moss]]es belonging to the family [[Polytrichaceae]].<ref name="GBIF">{{cite web |title=Atrichum P.Beauv. |url=https://www.gbif.org/species/2673296 |website=www.gbif.org |access-date=18 February 2021 |language=en}}</ref>

The genus was first described by [[Palisot de Beauvois]].<ref name="GBIF" />

The genus has [[cosmopolitan distribution]].<ref name="GBIF" />

Species:
* ''[[Atrichum angustatum]]''
* ''[[Atrichum crispum]]''
* ''[[Atrichum flavisetum]]''
* ''[[Atrichum tenellum]]''
* ''[[Atrichum undulatum]]''

